1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
Five seconds left until we switch to those high knees.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,720
And switch it up.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,160
Drive those knees up nice and high.

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,160
Remember, try to give them at least a hip height higher

5
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,160
if you can.

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,560
Barely let those feet touch the ground

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,680
before you drive them right back up again.

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,720
Just keep it going.

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,720
And that is halfway right there.

10
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,980
You got 20 seconds left.

11
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,160
Keep driving those knees up.

12
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,000
I know those legs are getting really nice and tired,

13
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,460
but remember, keep trying to get those knees

14
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,680
at least a hip height.

15
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,640
And we're almost done.

16
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,940
We've got just five seconds left

17
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,040
before we switch to burpees.

18
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,600
Just keep those knees moving.

19
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:45,760
And let it relax.

20
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,880
Come and switch to those burpees.

21
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,240
Go to that full pushup.

22
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,400
Nice jump at the top.

23
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,640
And then back out to that pushup.

24
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,040
Just keep switching back and forth.

25
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,700
Nice fluid motion.

26
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,960
Try to get those feet all the way out.

27
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,160
Remember, moving those.

